# Prisma / Database Rules

## Source of truth

`packages/db/schema.prisma` — all models and enums live here.

## Conventions

- Primary keys: `@default(cuid())` (not UUID)
- Table names: `@@map("snake_case_table")`
- Tenant tables: include `organizationId` + relation to `Organization`
- Refresh tokens: store `tokenHash` only, never raw tokens
- Usage: `Organization.messagesUsedThisMonth` — increment on AI completion, reset via cron

## Indexes

- Conversations: `@@index([organizationId, createdAt(sort: Desc)])`
- Messages: `@@index([conversationId, createdAt(sort: Asc)])`

## Enums

`Plan` (FREE, PRO, ENTERPRISE), `MemberRole`, `MessageRole`

## Migrations

- Dev: `prisma migrate dev`
- Prod: `prisma migrate deploy` — never `synchronize: true`

## Domain separation

Prisma types stay in infrastructure mappers — domain entities do not import `@prisma/client`.
